    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρεμ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>quiet, gentle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῦπαι,
			ἡδοναί</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				734a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Plt.</u>
					307a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ ἠ</span>. <i>a slight</i>
			fever, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.38
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμικρὰ καὶ ἠ</span>., opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλα καὶ σφοδρά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				733c
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλιν -οτέραν ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			: irreg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρεμέστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					7.5.63
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Vent.</u>
				29
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίως,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρέμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				12.14.1
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίτερον</span> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αιότερον</span>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				368a12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστέρως ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.1.30
				</span></i>
			.</div>
